# What NOT to upload to Vercel.
#
# Vercel installs dependencies and runs the build itself, so a deploy only
# needs the sources it builds from — not node_modules (172 MB), not a local
# dist, and not the raw client material the site was cut from.
#
# Careful: as soon as this file exists Vercel stops falling back to
# .gitignore, so everything heavy has to be named here too, even if
# .gitignore already covers it.

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr

# Raw client assets — source photographs, layered logos and the print
# brochure. The web-ready versions live in public/assets, which IS uploaded.
JPGs
LOGO
company_assets
/*.mp4
reference
*.pdf

# Superseded images in public/ that the site no longer references: the raw
# brochure page extracts (2-5 MB PNGs each, replaced by the WebP sets in
# assets/opt) and the brochure-era WebP sets replaced by the client's own
# renders and plan PDFs. They stay in git for the asset scripts; the site
# never requests them. Check a file is unused in src/ before adding it here.
# Every top-level PNG is a brochure extract except the footer's RERA QR code.
/public/assets/*.png
!/public/assets/rera-qr.png
/public/assets/hero-*.jpg
/public/assets/branding/aranya-logo-light.png
/public/assets/branding/champagne-editorial-panel.jpg
/public/assets/branding/skyline-editorial.jpg
/public/assets/branding/zaveri-bkm-partnership.png
/public/assets/opt/city-*
/public/assets/opt/plan-*
/public/assets/opt/amenities-overview-*
/public/assets/opt/amenity-banquet-gazebo-*
/public/assets/opt/amenity-fitness-center-*
/public/assets/opt/amenity-games-room-*
/public/assets/opt/amenity-kids-play-*
/public/assets/opt/amenity-pickleball-*
/public/assets/opt/amenity-rooftop-yoga-*
/public/assets/opt/amenity-senior-citizens-*
/public/assets/opt/connectivity-conveniences-*
/public/assets/opt/consultant-partners-*
/public/assets/opt/developer-profile-*
/public/assets/opt/hero-elevation-*
/public/assets/opt/life-lobby-arrival-*
/public/assets/opt/location-map-infra-*
/public/assets/opt/lifestyle-living-*
/public/assets/opt/master-layout-plan-*
/public/assets/opt/project-specifications-*
/public/assets/opt/render-entrance-drive-*
/public/assets/opt/render-lift-lobby-*
/public/assets/opt/render-tower-day-*
/public/assets/opt/render-tower-dusk-*
/public/assets/opt/residences-interior-*

# Local tooling, never served
scripts
.claude
graphify-out
.vscode
.idea

# Logs and local env
*.log
*.local
